==Battleground==
*1 [[Festival Sign Girl]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn after 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>, delay 7~12.67 seconds<sup>210f~380f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 25.67 seconds<sup>770f</sup>, delay 9~13.33 seconds<sup>270f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 7~14 seconds<sup>210f~420f</sup>.
**1 [[Vendor El]] spawns.
**1 [[Owlbrow]] spawns.
**3 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 9~15.67 seconds<sup>270f~470f</sup>.
**6 [[Duche]]s spawn, delay 25 seconds<sup>750f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Vendor El]]s spawn, delay 23 seconds<sup>690f</sup>.
**1 [[Duche]] spawns.
**2 [[Vendor El]]s spawn, delay 15.33~23.33 seconds<sup>460f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**2 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (200%) spawns.
**1 [[Vendor El]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Even with 5 Vendor Els, they lack the ability to push. Instead, the real threat are the Shadow Boxer K, who can push the Vendor Els into range of your [[Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Spam meatshields, and [[Paris Cat]], since Paris is very helpful to handle the Shadow Boxers.

For those looking to farm Lucky Tickets, this stage is a terrible choice given the fact that any kind of fast clear demands Uber Cannon Start combos and Uber rushers such as [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Immortal Yukimura]], as well as the inherently RNG nature of Vendor El's Weaken. It is highly advised to farm literally anything else or to just wait for [[Icy Desire]] to roll around.

